00:20:50.010 --> 00:20:52.260
you, like, if you
you're training

00:20:52.260 --> 00:20:55.035
and your predictions
are wildly nuts,

00:20:55.035 --> 00:20:56.880
and you can't figure
it out, you probably

00:20:56.880 --> 00:20:58.470
forgot to divide by 255.

00:20:58.470 --> 00:20:59.950
So there you have it.

00:20:59.950 --> 00:21:03.760
Now it's on the internet.

