00:49:38.580 --> 00:49:39.702
Strings.

00:49:39.702 --> 00:49:40.660
Which is what you want.

00:49:40.660 --> 00:49:43.850
And you know what else you
can't encode into JSON?

00:49:43.850 --> 00:49:44.980
Bytes.

00:49:44.980 --> 00:49:47.496
And so you try to call
this and it doesn't work,

00:49:47.496 --> 00:49:49.120
