clean and readable as

01:14:44.600 --> 01:14:50.234
possible while leveraging
the benefits of the estimator

01:14:50.234 --> 01:14:52.650
distribution strategies and
distribution technology that's

01:14:52.650 --> 01:14:55.390
under the hood there.

